WEBVTT

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.820
We will now begin the Japanese featherweight title match!

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:15.360
First, we have the challenger coming out of the blue corner, Sawamura Ryuuhei!

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:21.290
This is the Owari Dragon, who counts his Left Bullet and Lightning Right among his weapons!

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.790
The Dragon stands in the middle of the ring, gazing at...

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.590
the Japanese Featherweight Champion,

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.690
Makunouchi Ippo!

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.260
Just listen to those punches as they cut through the air!

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.540
He goes to the red corner!

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.000
This is his fifth title defense.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.480
Will Makunouchi remain the KO King?

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.580
Or will the Owari Dragon end his reign?

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:06.450
Whoa! The challenger rushes in! The bell hasn't even rung yet!

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.400
Not yet, Sawamura!

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.780
<i>Does he really want to fight that badly?</i>

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:19.840
<i>Fine by me!</i>

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:23.910
That stunt must've flipped a switch within the champion.

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:26.060
He comes forward without waiting for the start of the match.

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:30.060
<i>I'm coming after you. I won't back down!</i>

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:37.260
A storm is brewing as we wait for the bell.

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.490
Both fighters rush forward!

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:47.490
But wait! The challenger goes right past!

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:49.500
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.330
Wh-What is he doing?

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.500
Is he playing mind games? Mocking him?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.650
He's scoping him out.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:01.760
He's wondering what's the best way to devour him.

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:13.020
Please turn around and face me!

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:20.990
The champion comes with a quick right hand!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:27.480
He wastes no time taking advantage of that stumble! He has him on the ropes!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.080
He breaks the guard!

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:38.460
Oh, but he lands on his rear!

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.010
Why did he have to slip there?

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:44.350
<i>You're kidding!</i>

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.260
<i>I haven't gotten up yet!</i>

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:51.720
H-He took a swing at the fallen champion!

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:54.230
What are you doing? Take a walk!

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.480
And the referee deducts a point!

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.950
The challenger is now down a point!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.490
His first punch of the night was an astonishingly illegal one!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:09.260
Is he out of his mind?!

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:12.530
He made sure he was down before punching him!

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:14.160
He didn't fall on his own.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.320
Sawamura tripped him.

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:21.000
Ippo's a damn boy scout. 
Nothing else will piss him off more.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:25.110
Are we clear? Next time you do that, you forfeit the match!

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:26.130
Are you listening?

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:29.010
Aren't you even ashamed?!

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:30.600
Don't diss the champion!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.100
This ain't a street fight, you clown!

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:35.530
God, what a dick!

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.890
Makunouchi, go knock him on his ass!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.310
I'm fine, restart the match.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.650
Don't stand around, get in there!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.610
Go get him, Makunouchi!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.480
Box!

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.900
The champion's on the hunt!

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:50.210
Those hooks he's raining are fists of actual fury!

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:53.090
He doesn't even care if they're being blocked!

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:54.950
He backs the challenger to a corner!

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:00.710
A counter!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.040
Dead on!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.300
He dodges it!

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.270
That keen left barely grazes his hair!

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.890
He dodges another one!

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.640
He can avoid those counters?

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:18.890
All those title defenses put Makunouchi on a whole new level.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.740
The champion returns with a piercing liver blow!

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.820
The challenger's poker face is now writhing in pain!

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.240
And another body blow!

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.490
Followed by a straight right!

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:41.000
That's the bell and the end of the first round!

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:45.500
The champion takes a stance that seems to say, "How do you like that?"

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:49.510
Now that's a champion who doesn't let an illegal punch faze him!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.100
<i>This isn't over by a long shot.</i>

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:57.540
The champion dominated the first round!

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.300
The challenger watches him walk away!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:03.020
Will the challenger be able to rally back?

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:06.030
He ain't gonna let it end this way.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:10.770
<i>I don't care who wins, but don't let him get hurt!</i>

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:12.030
<i>Keep him safe, please!</i>

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:14.070
Round two!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:17.550
It's now the second round!

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:20.910
Whoa! The challenger wants to tap gloves!

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.250
What brought on this gentlemanly behavior?

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:28.710
I knew it was a fake!

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:29.920
What a douche!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.300
<i>Nice look you've got.</i>

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.390
<i>All it does is cure the meat.</i>

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:37.060
Talk about your dirty tricks.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:40.560
Is he really as good as you say he is?

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.850
This isn't the true Sawamura.

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.440
He must have something brutal up his sleeve.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.520
The champion dives in!

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.490
He pushes him back with a flurry of punches!

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:57.370
<i>A boxing match is where we both put our training to practice!</i>

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:03.250
<i>Where we compare the skills and self-worth we gain from training!</i>

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:07.250
<i>So why do you commit all those fouls and offenses?</i>

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.910
<i>Don't make a mockery of boxing!</i>

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.550
A thunderous body blow!

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.050
That one really put a dent into him!

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.220
Whoa, watch out!

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:23.450
Those damn counters!

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.690
That gave me chills!

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.990
<i>His timing is almost perfect!</i>

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.690
<i>I need to concentrate. Concentrate!</i>

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:33.020
<i>Shoot. I thought you'd be sloppier than this.</i>

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:35.200
<i>Yet, you're able to move that fast?</i>

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.950
<i>But I know how fast you swing.</i>

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.460
<i>Once I raise my tempo, you're mine.</i>

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.750
<i>He sped up his instep!</i>

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.050
Down he goes! It's a down!

00:06:56.790 --> 00:07:00.360
The champion throws a heavy blow in the second round!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.060
Here comes the count!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.060
<i>I know you felt that. Now what?</i>

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:14.740
But the challenger gets up as if nothing happened!

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.660
His knees are buckling!

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.350
You knew you couldn't stay up!

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.710
He can't continue! Stop the fight, Referee!

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.720
<i>No wonder he has so many KO's.</i>

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:33.260
<i>That would put out anyone who ate it.</i>

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.320
The challenger manages to take up a fighting pose.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.040
Box!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.260
The fight continues!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.890
The champion goes for the kill!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.880
The challenger can only block him!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.240
At least he's up.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.090
But that punch cuts right to the bone.

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.100
He's not gonna recover soon.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:52.400
He can't take another one.

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:00.200
The challenger's on the ropes!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.740
<i>Damn, I can't maintain my footing.</i>

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.490
<i>Here's my chance!</i>

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:06.040
<i>It's not fair!</i>

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.710
Oh! He clinches!

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.300
And they fall!

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:17.300
<i>H-He tripped me again!</i>

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:21.140
It's not fair that you get to do all the punching.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.060
Let me punch you too.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.270
Get up!

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.520
What's with you? Get up!

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:34.000
The challenger's still not getting up!

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.280
Are his legs not listening to him?

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:38.740
He's just buying time!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.340
Make him get up, Referee!

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:41.490
He'll recover!

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:44.150
<i>Come on, start the match!</i>

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.540
<i>This is my chance!</i>

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:55.500
The referee directs him to the blue corner. It appears his taping is loose.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.050
The match is paused for the moment.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.850
<i>But he was the one who tore it off!</i>

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.550
<i>Does his reputation matter that little to him?</i>

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.620
He's just buying more time!

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.540
You're a scumbag, Sawamura!

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.560
Are we watching the same match, Referee?

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:12.810
I'm done here. Now get out there.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.490
Give me... more time...

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:21.570
<i>This should have ended sooner, if he were the boxer I thought he was.</i>

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:26.610
<i>But he's gotten a lot stronger for this match.</i>

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:28.240
<i>Color me surprised.</i>

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:32.080
<i>I took a lot of damage trying to close that gap.</i>

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.520
I can't stall any longer!

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:35.950
Now go!

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:44.240
We're restarting the match! Get out of your corner!

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:45.600
Sure, I'm good.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.350
<i>And 100 percent.</i>

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:50.230
Box!

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:53.100
<i>You only stopped the match for 20 seconds!</i>

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:55.740
<i>I don't think you've completely recovered!</i>

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.400
<i>I still have my chance!</i>

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:09.690
<i>This isn't the same person I've been boxing!</i>

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:16.910
The challenger switched from a guardless stance to one where he's putting out his left glove!

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:20.710
Is the champion cautious? He hasn't taken another step!

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:24.720
He does have an acute ability to sense danger.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.710
But this is Sawamura's real pose.

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:33.330
This is the pose he takes when he knows he's facing a strong opponent!

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:40.230
You're saying we're seeing the real Sawamura?

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:41.510
Yeah.

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:46.030
In other words, he knows he needs to get serious in order to beat Makunouchi.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.720
The fighters are at a stalemate!

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:53.790
Only 40 seconds remain in the second round!

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:56.030
<i>I've never seen this stance before.</i>

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:57.640
<i>His body seems far away.</i>

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.710
<i>What to do? How do I get in?</i>

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.300
That left hand is in the way!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.510
Add that rhythm to it...

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:10.720
<i>It's going up and down, matching my urge to get a move on.</i>

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.310
<i>I think he's trying to match my timing!</i>

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:16.810
<i>But things are going nowhere fast!</i>

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:22.610
<i>Good! And before he brings his fist back...</i>

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.240
<i>He's already brought it back for another punch!</i>

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.090
<i>It didn't come back all the way to his chin!</i>

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:31.120
<i>He's got that left out to...</i>

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.250
He's gonna punch!

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:42.250
Whoa! That blew the champion backwards!

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.230
<i>Was that... his jab?!</i>

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:48.070
<i>It felt like a small, round, and powerful projectile.</i>

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:50.260
<i>And it blasted right through me!</i>

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.680
His nose is bleeding!

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:53.800
Wasn't he blocking?!

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.270
Was the punch that hard?!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.750
He twisted his wrist and shoulders when throwing that left.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:04.150
His punch drilled in a way that focused all his strength into one tiny area.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:10.910
It may look like the corkscrew punch favored by Latin American boxers, but I call it like I see it.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.290
The Bullet!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.200
<i>It looks like he's pointing a gun at me.</i>

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.950
<i>I know he has his finger on the trigger!</i>

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:23.290
<i>If I move, he'll peel off a Bullet!</i>

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:26.410
<i>But I can make him miss the vital areas!</i>

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.300
<i>He can pull the trigger all he wants!</i>

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.050
The champion goes up the middle!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.600
<i>Forget those punches, just go for his throat!</i>

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.980
It's a hail of Bullets!

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.040
Those lefts are coming from everywhere!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.520
The champion can't get in close!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.030
That left is like a machine gun!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.270
Whoa, he couldn't avoid that!

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:52.700
He's blasted back to the center!

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:56.280
<i>How could he pull off all those powerful lefts?</i>

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.770
<i>Not to mention maintaining their pinpoint accuracy?</i>

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:01.460
<i>The kid can no longer rush in blindly!</i>

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:03.460
<i>You see that?</i>

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.450
Good God.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:10.530
To do a corkscrew, you need to create momentum with your body and twist around.

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:12.120
It can't be done repeatedly.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:17.680
But all he does is flex his elbow at constant angles and turn his shoulder inward.

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:21.080
You can only do that if you've got a strong shoulder and wrist.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.000
It's not something that can be taught.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:26.260
He's not someone who wants to be taught, anyway.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.990
He hates taking lessons from anybody.

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:33.490
The guy was born to punch people.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.480
That left's hard to handle!

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:37.520
He could get a down with that jab!

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:39.750
He's still gonna go after him.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.870
He's more incensed than he usually is.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:45.500
Ippo's gonna cowboy his way in.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.300
Makunouchi-san.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:53.260
Doesn't matter if it's strong or quick, a single left ain't gonna stop him.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.610
Stop wasting time, Makunouchi.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:59.770
Hurry up and break two or three of his ribs already!

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:02.490
<i>I won't lose!</i>

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:05.770
<i>I will never lose to him!</i>

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:10.320
<i>I will not back away from any fight or slugfest!</i>

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.710
Oh! And that's the bell!

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.760
The second round's done!

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:29.800
It looks like he's really angry.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.720
He'll come after me in the next round, count on it.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.220
Yeah, he'll definitely come.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.580
<i>That's where the trap is set.</i>

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.490
Good Lord.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:45.800
That guy is a better natural counterpuncher than I am.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.860
Makunouchi might actually lose.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:48.910
What was that?

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:53.310
He's better than you? You can sense that?

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.590
I'm sure he'll demonstrate that.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.240
Demonstrate what?

00:14:57.240 --> 00:15:03.120
Something I and every other counterpuncher out there can learn from.

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:05.150
Round three!

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:11.170
Here we are in the third round, with the champion moving in at the urging of the crowd!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.550
But, the challenger isn't letting him do any infighting!

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:19.200
<i>He's making sure I can't reach him!</i>

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.760
<i>I have to get in closer!</i>

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.910
There's his cross-arm block!

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.560
He blocks the Bullets as he inches forward!

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:30.570
<i>You can't maintain that tight guard and punch at the same time.</i>

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:41.450
That's right, force your way in.

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:43.410
That's the only way to do it.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.330
Wh-What is it?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.600
He knows Makunouchi has to force his way in.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:53.340
So what has he planned?

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:58.900
<i>All that dirty fighting served to make Makunouchi's rhythm more regular.</i>

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:02.260
<i>The Bullet is so incredible that it added fuel to his rage.</i>

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:07.890
<i>Makunouchi's determination to get closer to him is making his rhythm too regular.</i>

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:12.900
<i>He's laying all sorts of traps.
 The situation's almost too perfect!</i>

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.330
<i>Yes, he's in front of me!</i>

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.820
<i>Here goes!</i>

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:24.310
<i>You probably feel the electricity coming from your head to your fingertips.</i>

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.950
<i>Its speed and impact are like a thunderclap.</i>

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.920
<i>That's your Lightning Right!</i>

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:38.590
Out comes his mouthpiece along with some blood!

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:40.000
What just happened?

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:44.100
I-It's his right! It's his right counter!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.250
God dammit!

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:48.060
It was so fast, I could only see the end of it!

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:52.380
The champion's falling backwards!

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.860
Can he regain his footing?

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.190
Kid!

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:07.240
<i>Wait! Why am I seeing the mat?</i>

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:10.890
<i>Why is he over there?</i>

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:12.750
<i>I have to punch! I have to attack!</i>

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.250
He regains his footing!

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:21.260
His legs aren't working! He's still hurting!

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:23.490
<i>My feet aren't going forward!</i>

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:26.240
<i>What happened? Did I get punched?</i>

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:28.270
<i>The right? Was it a right counter?</i>

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.570
<i>He's just now realizing it!</i>

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:34.480
<i>Sawamura's right was simply that fast.</i>

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.660
He rains a barrage of lefts looking to put him out!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.200
<i>I'm not backing away! I'm hitting back!</i>

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:49.750
He's being kept completely at bay.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.790
He can either clinch or back off entirely.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:55.320
But Makunouchi will never back off.

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:57.730
He'll always try to return a punch.

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.800
That's one of his strong points.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.800
But that's backfiring on him. Now he's just a sandbag.

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:07.560
We can catch glimpses of his face swelling up!

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.930
Is he even conscious?

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.650
Whoa! He swings back!

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:15.900
<i>Not over yet!</i>

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:19.820
The champion's still going in!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.820
<i>I thought you'd be well-done by now, but I guess you're still too rare.</i>

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.780
<i>I got through! I can do this!</i>

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:34.250
<i>Oh no! He has his timing down completely!</i>

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.990
Whoa! That counter came in like a firebolt!

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:40.760
That Lightning Right went straight through the champion!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.470
He leans on the challenger to avoid a down!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.470
That's the end of the third round!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:51.910
<i>You still don't look ready to eat.</i>

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.190
Kid, are you all right?

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.080
I'm fine.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:58.730
I can still...

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:01.440
<i>That right counter...</i>

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:03.940
<i>It left me conscious but unable to move.</i>

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:06.960
<i>My nervous system was unable to function.</i>

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:10.680
<i>If I do get through those lefts, that right will be waiting for me!</i>

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:14.790
<i>Somewhere along the way he transitions from a serial fouler to a serious boxer.</i>

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.210
<i>Dammit, what do I do?!</i>

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.940
Don't panic.

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:24.700
Fists of fire and a cool head. Those are the basics.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.180
The basics?

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:30.140
Those Left Bullets are his lifeline.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:32.930
He's also found a good distance and timing for them.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:37.100
You need to find a way to slip through those lefts.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:41.810
<i>In order to slip through, I need to tighten my guard and sway my body.</i>

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:43.270
<i>The very basics!</i>

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.200
You're in control of this match.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:51.180
However, Makunouchi is still able to stick with it, no matter how beaten up he looks.

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.760
Don't rush things, take your time, and hurt him more.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:56.540
I don't like eating tough meat.

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:01.280
I will wait for him to slowly tenderize...

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:04.480
then devour him.
